@title Welcome to Customer Success
@subtitle A letter for the November 2026 cohort at Larkspur Software

Hi, and welcome to Larkspur. We are glad you are here.

The Customer Success team has 42 people across Denver, Dublin and Singapore. We help customers get real value from our product, and we look out for each other while we do it.

## Your first week

- **Monday:** laptop pickup at 09:00, then a welcome breakfast.
- **Tuesday:** product deep dive with the Solutions team.
- **Wednesday:** shadow two customer calls.
- **Thursday:** support tooling training.
- **Friday:** lunch with your onboarding buddy.

## Your first 90 days

By day 30, you will know the product well enough to explain it to a customer. Spend this stretch learning, asking questions and sitting in on calls.

By day 60, you will own five accounts alongside your buddy. You will take the lead on day-to-day contact while your buddy reviews your work with you.

By day 90, you will run quarterly business reviews on your own. Your buddy will still be a message away, and we will check in with you regularly.

## People to know

- Nadia Farouk, VP of Customer Success
- Owen Achterberg, Head of Support
- Priyanka Rao, Enablement lead

! Tip: the #cs-newbies channel is the best place to ask anything. No question is too small.

Welcome aboard,

Nadia Farouk, VP of Customer Success
